# Biodiversity Explorer runs entirely on free, keyless public APIs
# (GBIF + Wikipedia), so no environment variables are required to run it.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder for contributors who want to wire up
# optional future integrations (e.g. an IUCN Red List API key for richer
# conservation data: https://apiv3.iucnredlist.org/).
#
# IUCN_API_KEY=
